"| **Code** |           Name          |\n"
"+=======+==========+================+\n"
"| en   | English       |\n"
"| es   | Spanish        |\n"
"| fr   | French         |\n"
"| de   | German         |\n"
"| ...  |                |\n"
"+-------+---------------+\n"
"\n"
"*ISO 639-2 (B):*\n"
"+--+----------+-----------------------------------------+\n"
"| **Code** |           Name                               |\n"
"+=======+==============================================+\n"
"| en   | English language                         |\n"
"| es   | Spanish language                          |\n"
"| fr   | French language                           |\n"
"| de   | German language                           |\n"
"| ...  |                                      |\n"
"+-------+---------------------------------------------\n"
"\n"
"*ISO 639-2 (T):*\n"
"+--+----------+----------------------------------------------------+\n"
"| **Code** |           Name                                         |\n"
"+=======+=====================================================+\n"
"| en   | English language                                     |\n"
"| es   | Spanish language                                      |\n"
"| fr   | French language                                       |\n"
"| de   | German language                                       |\n"
