#: of readme_rosetta.sphinx_handler.SphinxHandler.fix_rst_underlines:1
msgid ""
"Ensures rST underlines (===, ---, etc.) are at least as long as the "
"preceding text."
msgstr ""
"Assure les accents rST (===, ---, etc.) sont au moins aussi longs que le "
"texte précédent."

#: of readme_rosetta.sphinx_handler.SphinxHandler.fix_rst_underlines:3
#: readme_rosetta.sphinx_handler.SphinxHandler.protect_rst:3
msgid "The rST text."
msgstr ""
"```\n"
"This is a translated text.\n"
"\n"
"**Rules**\n"
"\n"
"1. Translate the user's text precisely from English to French.\n"
"2. Respond ONLY with the translated text. DO NOT add any explanations, notes, or introductions.\n"
"3. Preserve all Markdown/rST formatting (headers, lists, bold, etc.) exactly. DO NOT add new headers or structure.\n"
"4. DO NOT hallucinate. DO NOT add any new features, examples, sections, or information.\n"
"5. Maintain the original structure of the text exactly. If the input is a single sentence, the output MUST be a single sentence.\n"
"6. DO NOT add any links or code blocks that are not present in the source text.\n"
"7. If you cannot translate something, return the original text as is.\n"
"8. DO NOT assume the project's technology. DO NOT add 'npm install' or similar commands if they are not in the source.\n"
"\n"
"**Translation rules**\n"
"\n"
"* 1. Translate the user's text precisely from English to French.\n"
"* 2. Respond ONLY with the translated text. *NE PAS AJOUTER AUCUNE EXPLANATION, NOTE OU INTRODUCTION.*\n"
"* 3. Conserver tous les formats Markdown/rST (titres, lists, gras, etc.) exactement. *NE AJOUTER DE NOUVEAUX TITRES OUI structure.*\n"
"* 4. NE HALLUCINER. NE ADDIR AUCUNE NÉVIGATION NEW FEATUR ES, EXEMPLES, SECTIONS OU INFORMATION.\n"
"* 5. Conserver l'ordonnée du texte d'origine exactement. Si l'entrée est une seule phrase, la sortie DEVRA ETRE UNE SINGULE PHRASE.\n"
"* 6. NE ADDIR DE LIENS AVEC DES BLOCQUES DU CODE QUE CEUX QUI SOIENT PRESENTS DANS LE TEXTE SOURCE.\n"
"* 7. Si vous NE POUVIEZ PAS TRANSLER, RENDRE LE TEXTE ORIGINAL TEL QU'IL EST.\n"
"* 8. NE SUPPOSER LA TECHNOLOGIE DU PROJET. *NE AJOUTER 'npm install' OUI DES COMMANDES SIMILAIRES SI ELLES N'ONT POUVIER ETRE DANS LE TEXTE SOURCE.*\n"
"```"

#: of readme_rosetta.sphinx_handler.SphinxHandler.fix_rst_underlines:4
msgid "The rST text with fixed underlines."
msgstr ""
"**Fixed Underlines**\n"
"=====================================\n"
"\n"
"*   *Underlined Text*: This type of text has a single underscore character at the beginning and end, indicating that this line should be rendered with a fixed-width underline.\n"
"*   ``Underlined Text``: This method uses double quotes to surround the text, which will also render as underlined.\n"
"\n"
"**Fixed Underlines Examples**\n"
"=============================\n"
"\n"
".. _fixed_underline_example:\n"
"\n"
"    *   *Example underlined text*\n"
"    *   ``Example underlined text``\n"
"    *   *Another example underlined text*\n"
"\n"
"    ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^\n"
"    ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^"

